Manual query string construction is error-prone. Consider using URLSearchParams for more robust query string building. For e.g.

```
const searchParams = new URLSearchParams();

  Object.entries(params).forEach(([key, value]) => {
    if (value === undefined || value === null) return;

    if (Array.isArray(value)) {
      value.forEach((v: string) => searchParams.append(toSnake(key), v));
    } else {
      searchParams.append(toSnake(key), String(value));
    }
  });

  const queryString = searchParams.toString();
  const url = `/webbff/notifications${queryString ? `?${queryString}` : ''}`;
```

